# ADR-0001: Alpha

* **Status**: Accepted
* **Date**: 2026-10-21

<!-- semedit-adr-metadata:v1 keys=summary,description,role,scope,area,languages; do not change key names or order. -->
| Key | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| summary | First duplicate decision. |
| description | Duplicate identifier fixture. |
| role | architecture |
| scope | project |
| area | documentation |
| languages | generic |

## Context

The first record occupies identifier 0001.

## Decision

Keep the first record.

## Invariants

* The record is individually valid.

## Consequences

Its identifier conflicts with the next record.
